- Individual MW and M31 entropy contributions.
- Dynamical mixing during merger evolution.

Additionally developed angular-momentum autocorrelation diagnostics to estimate:

      λ_mix

the spatial coherence length of angular momentum structures.

This quantifies how rapidly initially ordered structures become phase mixed.

